<title>DUBAI: Iran's NIOC cuts bunker fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Iran's NIOC cuts bunker fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Iranian Oil Company (NIOC) has cut the price of 280-cst bunker fuel lifted from Kharg Island by $1 a tonne to $99.50 a tonne effective July 17.</p>
<p>A price telex from NIOC's Petroleum Products Marketing and Operations division said prices from Bandar Mahshahr would be $95.50 a tonne, down from $96 a tonne on July 3.</p>
</text>
